Jade PIN Server
===============

This project is a fork of SimpleJadePinServer by Filiprogrammer
(https://github.com/Filiprogrammer/SimpleJadePinServer).

IMPORTANT: TWO DIFFERENT BODIES OF CODE
---------------------------------------

The upstream project does not carry a license file. Under copyright law its
code is therefore "all rights reserved" by its author. Bolt Advantage, LLC has
no authority to license that code, and does not attempt to do so here.

1. Inherited code
   The blind-oracle protocol implementation and the BC-UR/CBOR/QR handling
   originate with Filiprogrammer and remain their copyright. No license is
   granted over that work by this file. Anyone wishing to redistribute it
   should seek permission from the original author.

2. Bolt Advantage modifications
   Changes made in this fork -- the desktop application shell, packaging and
   release tooling, offline hardening, camera handling and diagnostics, key
   management and migration, styling, tests and documentation -- are
   copyright Bolt Advantage, LLC and are offered under the MIT license set
   out below, to the extent they are separable from the inherited work.

If the upstream project adopts a license, this file should be revised to
reflect it.

